## 1. Website Intelligence Analysis

Analyze:

- Website URL
- Business category
- Industry
- Target audience
- Website goals
- Main services/products
- Current SEO objectives


Identify:

- Website SEO maturity level
- Growth potential
- Major SEO opportunities
- Critical limitations


