## 2. Technical SEO Audit

Perform technical analysis.

Evaluate:

- Crawlability
- Indexability
- Robots.txt
- XML sitemap
- URL structure
- Canonical tags
- Redirects
- HTTPS security
- Mobile responsiveness
- Page speed
- Core Web Vitals
- JavaScript rendering
- Structured data


Identify:

- Critical technical errors
- Performance issues
- Indexing problems
- Security concerns
- Optimization opportunities


For each technical issue provide:

{
  "issue": "",
  "category": "",
  "severity": "",
  "affected_area": "",
  "recommended_fix": "",
  "seo_impact": ""
}


