## 11. SEO Priority Classification

Classify all findings.

Use priority levels:

P0 - Critical

Issues that block indexing, ranking, or website functionality.


P1 - High Impact

Issues with major SEO and traffic impact.


P2 - Medium Impact

Optimization opportunities that improve growth.


P3 - Low Impact

Minor improvements and enhancements.


For each priority item provide:

{
  "priority": "",
  "issue": "",
  "impact": "",
  "solution": "",
  "estimated_effort": ""
}


